or C network number), even though they may currently have only a few
machines to hook up. 

Check out the RFC's on network numbering. Also, the so-called "Big Internet"
group is working on solutions for extending IP to handle this problem.
I believe their mailing list is gatewayed to alt.big.internet or something.

